+//
+// Resolves the ball bouncing off bricks. Given the ball's position at the
+// START of the step (`prevX`, `prevY`) and its position after the step, this
+// decides which brick was hit first, deflects the ball and pushes it back out
+// so it never sticks. Returns every brick the ball broke in this step (their
+// `alive` flag is set to `false` here so the caller can also score them).
